  "patch_text": "--- a/core/object/worker_thread_pool.cpp\n+++ b/core/object/worker_thread_pool.cpp\n@@ -756,6 +756,13 @@\n \n \tMutexLock task_lock(task_mutex); // This mutex is needed when Physics 2D and/or 3D is selected to run on a separate thread.\n \tgroups.erase(p_group);\n+#else\n+\t// In a single-thread build, posting runs synchronously. The waiter still\n+\t// owns the final group reference and must release it, including empty groups.\n+\tGroup **groupp = groups.getptr(p_group);\n+\tERR_FAIL_NULL_MSG(groupp, \"Invalid Group ID.\");\n+\tgroup_allocator.free(*groupp);\n+\tgroups.erase(p_group);\n #endif\n }\n \n",
